    <string name="creds_fa_help">FurAffinity has no public API and its login form is captcha-gated, so paste a FAC cookie copied from a browser that is already logged in: menu → Settings → Privacy → Clear browsing data gives the same cookie, or use Developer tools → Application → Cookies → furaffinity.net → FAC.</string>
